{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgkd88XLdF66JnUwy4Vc3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Avi, I tried, but this page wasn't really made for someone like me. If I had to pick today, I'd go with **הראל**, the **\"כספי (שקלי)\"** track. But I'm not opening anything until I've talked to you. I'm not sure about it.\n\n**Why that one:**\n- I know the name הראל, and it's a big company. On the second screen they're the cheapest. It says \"0.55%\" or \"0.57%\" next to \"ההיסכון\", and \"0%\" next to \"מההפקדות\".\n- \"כספי (שקלי)\" sounds like plain money in shekels, with no shares. Its row shows \"0%\" next to \"מניות\" and next to \"מט\"ח\".\n- It shows \"4.25%\" for 3 years. That looks a bit better than a deposit, but I'm not sure that's a real comparison.\n- I also saw a button for \"אג\"ח ממשלתי\". I know government bonds are safe, so that's what I'd really want. But I never found its rows in the list.\n\n**What I looked at:**\n- **Top of the page:** \"קופת גמל להשקעה\" was already highlighted, so I knew I was in the right place.\n- **The track buttons:** I recognised \"כללי\", \"מניות\", \"אג\"ח ממשלתי\" and \"כספי\". \"S&P 500\" and \"עוקב מדד\" I just skipped.\n- **The table:** I went through the rows for הראל, then מור, then a company called \"אנליסט\". I've never heard of אנליסט, so I'd steer clear of it. At the end I glanced at מיטב's \"כספי\" row: 0.58%, 4.41% for 3 years.\n- **Where I stopped:** after five screens. There are sixteen, so most of the page I never saw.\n\n**What I didn't understand or couldn't read:**\n- **The coloured rings:** I couldn't read them at all, and the turquoise and yellow look too much alike to me.\n- **Unclear numbers:** \"מט\"ח\" with \"99%\" next to it. Also \"חשיפה\", and \"פחות מ־3 שנים\" where a number should be.\n- **The returns:** \"לפני דמי ניהול\". Does that mean I get less than the number shown?\n- **Faint text:** the grey writing at the top and the small \"?\" signs were too pale to read, even enlarged.\n- **Abbreviations:** \"דמי ניהול ממוצע 2025\" and the small arrows in the headings.\n\n**Where I got tired and worried:**\n- The whole page is black, with lots of small numbers on every line.\n- By the third screen I was already anxious, and after the fifth I stopped.\n- I worried most when I saw big numbers like \"24.04%\" and \"26.39%\" next to \"מניות 100%\". That's the gambling kind.\n\n**What I'd change:** a light background and bigger letters. Plain words like \"safe, like a deposit\" at the top. And just one number per line, saying how much I pay, in shekels."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3686,"cache_read_input_tokens":9767,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3686},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5078f421-8288-4b87-9500-8bff3b9f392b","uuid":"d3acc332-9a8b-4ebb-b013-7148733755c3","timestamp":"2026-11-05T23:09:21.319Z","request_id":"req_011Cgkd88HhBjQTDuSJ2utir"}
